{"4398020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blastlane Racers", "steam_appid": 4398020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4986310], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explosive arcade combat racing</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>24 hand-crafted tracks</strong> across three unique environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your car between races</strong> with weapons and performance improvements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic 4-player splitscreen multiplayer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dangerous tracks</strong> packed with jumps, hazards and dynamic elements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398020/extras/fde947f4572892e4b04353a29dfba8eb.avif?t=1786702372\" width=1560 height=526 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic Arcade Combat Racing Reimagined</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blastlane Racers brings back the spirit of classic top-down combat racers and reimagines it with modern visuals and explosive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost with rockets, fire powerful weapons and outmaneuver rivals on dangerous tracks packed with jumps, hazards and dynamic track elements. Every race is a chaotic battle where skillful driving and clever upgrades decide who reaches the finish line first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398020/extras/c2d8c8d792be1a322d53574107687c18.avif?t=1786702372\" width=1560 height=526 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Car Between Races</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn prize money by winning races and destroying rivals throughout the championship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between races, visit the shop to improve your car with performance upgrades, stronger armor and powerful weapons. Choose carefully and build a machine that fits your driving style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398020/extras/8947b470cb1e579e139b55e5f9d4cae1.avif?t=1786702372\" width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chaotic 4-Player Splitscreen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blastlane Racers is built for couch competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends in 4-player splitscreen races where rockets fly, cars explode and victories are often decided in the final corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for chaotic multiplayer sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398020/extras/a35398abf5736ee2b68ebe5b38834d2a.avif?t=1786702372\" width=1560 height=526 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dangerous Tracks Full of Surprises</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each track is designed to challenge your driving skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >massive jumps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >deadly hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dynamic track elements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take risks and master the layout on your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398020/extras/fea04f0709b98ff559c101f578df232b.avif?t=1786702372\" width=1560 height=526 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race Across Diverse Locations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in championships across a variety of environments:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >tropical islands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >forests and mountain roads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >urban race arenas</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>24 hand-crafted tracks</strong> across these locations, each environment introduces new layouts, hazards and tactical opportunities.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explosive arcade combat racing</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>24 hand-crafted tracks</strong> across three unique environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your car between races</strong> with weapons and performance improvements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic 4-player splitscreen multiplayer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dangerous tracks</strong> packed with jumps, hazards and dynamic elements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398020/extras/fde947f4572892e4b04353a29dfba8eb.avif?t=1786702372\" width=1560 height=526 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic Arcade Combat Racing Reimagined</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blastlane Racers brings back the spirit of classic top-down combat racers and reimagines it with modern visuals and explosive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost with rockets, fire powerful weapons and outmaneuver rivals on dangerous tracks packed with jumps, hazards and dynamic track elements. Every race is a chaotic battle where skillful driving and clever upgrades decide who reaches the finish line first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398020/extras/c2d8c8d792be1a322d53574107687c18.avif?t=1786702372\" width=1560 height=526 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Car Between Races</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn prize money by winning races and destroying rivals throughout the championship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between races, visit the shop to improve your car with performance upgrades, stronger armor and powerful weapons. Choose carefully and build a machine that fits your driving style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398020/extras/8947b470cb1e579e139b55e5f9d4cae1.avif?t=1786702372\" width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chaotic 4-Player Splitscreen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blastlane Racers is built for couch competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends in 4-player splitscreen races where rockets fly, cars explode and victories are often decided in the final corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for chaotic multiplayer sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398020/extras/a35398abf5736ee2b68ebe5b38834d2a.avif?t=1786702372\" width=1560 height=526 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dangerous Tracks Full of Surprises</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each track is designed to challenge your driving skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >massive jumps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >deadly hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dynamic track elements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take risks and master the layout on your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398020/extras/fea04f0709b98ff559c101f578df232b.avif?t=1786702372\" width=1560 height=526 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race Across Diverse Locations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in championships across a variety of environments:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >tropical islands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >forests and mountain roads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >urban race arenas</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>24 hand-crafted tracks</strong> across these locations, each environment introduces new layouts, hazards and tactical opportunities.</p>", "short_description": "Explosive arcade combat racing. Boost with rockets, fire weapons and outmaneuver rivals on dangerous tracks packed with jumps and hazards. Upgrade your car between races, compete solo or battle friends in chaotic 4-player splitscreen.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398020/ecb5613731b34ee61845255e7230a7aeee6fed82/header.jpg?t=1786702372", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398020/7e53fc918dac11f26f46b21a8a42189ade6f087b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786702372", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398020/7e53fc918dac11f26f46b21a8a42189ade6f087b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786702372", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 / AMD Radeon R9 380<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:<